1-101.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/21-101.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Al-Anbiyaa 21:101 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Şüphesiz kendileri için tarafımızdan en güzel mükâfat hazırlanmış olanlar var ya; işte bunlar Cehennem&#x27;den uzaklaştırılmışlardır.\">\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/21-101.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn\">\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"tr_TR\">\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\">\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.webmanifest\">\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/icon-192.png\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Article\", \"headline\": \"Tefsiri: Al-Anbiyaa 21:101 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü'l-Kayyim'e göre\", \"description\": \"Şüphesiz kendileri için tarafımızdan en güzel mükâfat hazırlanmış olanlar var ya; işte bunlar Cehennem'den uzaklaştırılmışlardır.\", \"inLanguage\": \"tr\", \"url\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/21-101.html\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/21-101.html\", \"image\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\", \"author\": [{\"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye\"}, {\"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"İmam İbnü'l-Kayyim\"}], \"isPartOf\": {\"@type\": \"WebSite\", \"name\": \"Tefsîru'ş-Şeyhayn\", \"url\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/\"}}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \